    "Per-app validation wall time in SECONDS, consumed by",
    "build/generate-selfmig-shard-matrix.py (issue #3721). This is a seed,",
    "not a source of truth: the nightly gate measures the real numbers and",
    "publishes them as selfmig-shard-costs.json in the cs2gs-selfmig-run",
    "artifact, and the migrate job downloads that in preference to this file.",
    "Refresh this seed from an artifact when the corpus shifts enough that a",
    "cold first run would pack badly. Seeded from run 33433830972: the four",
    "shards that held a single app give that app's cost exactly (shard wall",
    "minus the ~6.6 min every shard spends on checkout/restore/build); the",
    "two bulk shards give only a shard total, apportioned across their apps",
    "by MSBuild elapsed time, which is the only per-app signal that run's",
    "artifacts carried. Unlisted apps are priced at the 75th percentile of",
    "the listed ones."
